  <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Cleveland State University</h2>
  <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;">4th Annual Regional Chemistry Symposium</h1>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">March 12 and 13, 2015</p>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Location</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">The 4th Annual Regional Chemistry Symposium will be held at <span data-field="university.name">{{ university.name }}</span>, <span data-field="location.building">{{ location.building }}</span>, <span data-field="location.address">{{ location.address }}</span> (corner of Euclid and East 22nd Street).</p>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">CLEVELAND STATE UNIVERSITY</h2>
    <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-top: 0;">CAMPUS MAP</h3>
    <img src="placeholder_map.png" alt="Campus Map" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
  </div>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Directions and Parking</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Parking for this conference is available under the Student Center (SC, number 22 on the map) located between East 21st and East 22nd Streets between Euclid and Chester Avenues. East 21st Street is one way only (south bound) and East 22nd Street is one way (north bound). Additional parking information will be available in the future.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 0;">Link to <a href="#" style="color: #0000EE;">CSU Campus Map</a></p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 5px;">Driving Directions to CSU</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Overnight Accommodations</h2>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Wyndham Cleveland at Playhouse Square</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">1260 Euclid Avenue, Cleveland Ohio 44115</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Visit <a href="#" style="color: #0000EE;">The Wyndham</a></p>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">The Wyndham Hotel, located at Playhouse Square in downtown Cleveland, is allowing affordable discount rates for attendees of the symposium. Transportation to CSU is available at the hotel—it is also a 4-minute walk to CSU.</p>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Deadline for limited special hotel rates: <span data-field="date">{{ date }}</span>, <span data-field="year">{{ year }}</span> PM</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">For reservations, call <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span> at Wyndham on Playhouse Square; <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></p>

  <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Conference events</h2>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Details about the symposium can be found at the EngagedScholarship@CSU Regional Chemistry Symposium website at <a href="#" style="color: #0000EE;">http://engagedscholarship.csuohio.edu/csurcts/</a></p>

  <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Airport</h2>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Cleveland International Airport (CLE) is located <span data-field="distance">{{ distance }}</span> from downtown Cleveland</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">They have direct rail service, with Regional Transit Authority <span data-field="rta_name">{{ rta_name }}</span> Red Line Rapid offering a short commute to downtown to <span data-field="tower_city">{{ tower_city }}</span>, on Public Square: <span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span>. Taxis are also available.</p>

  <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Public Transportation</h2>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">RTA provides numerous transportation options around the city, including the Healthcare, Downtown Bus/Rapid, and the Free Trolley. Maps and schedules can be found <a href="#" style="color: #0000EE;">here</a>.</p>

  <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Dining and Local Attractions</h2>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Many <span data-field="attraction_type">{{ attraction_type }}</span>, both casual and upscale, are within walking distance of Cleveland State University and are convenient to the Chemistry Symposium attendees.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">For those wishing to spend extra time in Cleveland, and to find out what our city has to offer, the following links provide information for dining and sightseeing.</p>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Tremont Dining: <a href="#" style="color: #0000EE;">http://www.urbanspoon.com/n/16/1543/Tremont-restaurants</a></p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Ohio City Dining: <a href="#" style="color: #0000EE;">http://www.ohiocity.org/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=106&itemid=229</a></p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">The Warehouse District: <a href="#" style="color: #0000EE;">http://www.warehousedistrict.org/visit.aspx</a></p>

  <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Sightseeing</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">The <span data-field="sightseeing_name">{{ sightseeing_name }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Great Lakes Science Center: <a href="#" style="color: #0000EE;">http://www.glsc.org/</a></p>
</div>

