  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Museum of Contemporary Art: <a href="#" style="color: #0000EE;">http://www.mocacleveland.org/</a></p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Cleveland Museum of Natural History: <a href="#" style="color: #0000EE;">http://cmnh.org/site/index.aspx</a></p>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Cleveland's <span data-field="university_circle">{{ university_circle }}</span> boasts a concentration of arts and cultural institutions, all within 1 square mile.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">More dining and entertainment can be found at <span data-field="entertainment_district">{{ entertainment_district }}</span>.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">For more information about Cleveland, visit <a href="#" style="color: #0000EE;">This is Cleveland</a>.</p>

  <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">General Chemistry Symposium 2012</h2>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Download our <span data-field="newsletter_link">{{ newsletter_link }}</span>.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">For more information about the 4th Annual Regional Chemistry Symposium, contact Dr. Jerry Mundell at <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span></p>
